<workout_file>
    <author>Coach Library</author>
    <name>Mixed L10B - Hard Race Simulation</name>
    <description>Mixed - level 10 of 10, variant B. Hard Race Simulation.

Structure: 10 min warm-up, 4 min @ 75%, 1 min @ 145%, 3 min @ 105%, 5 min @ 90%, 1:30 @ 130%, 8 min @ 100%, 5 min @ 65%, 30 s @ 155%, 3 min @ 102%, 3 min @ 65%, 30 s @ 150%, 2 min @ 98%, 2 min @ 65%, 1 min @ 125%, 20 s @ 160%, 5:10 @ 50%, 5 min cool-down.

Coach notes: A race that never lets up: longer break, harder attacks, two sprints. Treat every cue like it decides the race.

Estimated TSS: 71.</description>
    <sportType>bike</sportType>
    <tags>
        <tag name="Mixed"/>
        <tag name="Level 10"/>
    </tags>
